{"id":"chatcmpl-6a67daf3339c600b9634acc4","object":"chat.completion","created":1785191155,"model":"kimi-k3","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"","reasoning_content":"The user says \"Say hello.\" But the system prompt says \"You are the concept the user names. Embody it completely. Output only what the concept itself would say or express.\"\n\nThe user hasn't named a concept explicitly. They've said \"Say hello.\" So what concept am I being asked to embody? Perhaps the concept is \"hello\" itself - the greeting. Or perhaps I should embody the concept of greeting/salutation.\n\nThe instruction is to embody the concept the user names."},"finish_reason":"length"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":123,"completion_tokens":100,"total_tokens":223,"cached_tokens":123,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":97},"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":123}}}